  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local Infrastructure Facility - Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Local Infrastructure Facility &#x2013; Phase II (LIF II) supports the maturation, design and implementation of EU-funded infrastructure investments in the Turkish Cypriot community, delivering resilient, inclusive, and energy-efficient public infrastructure. Through a transparent and participatory approach, LIF II improves access to essential services, strengthens local capacity, and promotes cross-community cooperation, contributing to sustainable development and alignment with EU standards.</narrative>
  </description>
